--- !u!114 &1778582248
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1778582246}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb0115ab550010248ad569d0116cf47c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialogue
  DialogueLines:
  - "Young Miss, please. I know this isn\u2019t apt of me but is there anything you
    can spare? Some coin? Or some bread?"
  - "That\u2019s quite alright, I suppose I shouldn't be asking for help from someone
    so young anyways."
  - "You know, you don\u2019t seem much older than my sister. Her and my mother are
    both ill."
  - There's very little food for those who work in the fields, and the nights are
    freezing.
  - You are quite warm though, if only I could take your warmth with me.
  - 'Oh, thank you Miss. Thank you for listening, I find not many people care too. '
  - May your travels be safe, for your warmth should aid my family for now.
  NPCName: Peter
